@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #DCE1E3
  BorderColor #2B2D42
}

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #2B2D42
  FontName "Arial"
}

title System Context Diagram (C4 Level 1) - LaPrizza Information System

actor "Customer" as Customer <<Person>> #E2EAFC
note right of Customer
  Interacts via Web Application or
  self-service kiosk anonymously.
  Browses catalogue, configures pizzas,
  simulates and places orders.
end note

actor "Restaurant Manager" as Manager <<Person>> #E2EAFC
note top of Manager
  Holds MANAGER role.
  Maintains catalogues, products,
  allergens, recipes, stock balances,
  and manages system users and roles.
end note

actor "Restaurant Employee" as Employee <<Person>> #E2EAFC
note left of Employee
  Holds EMPLOYEE role.
  Inspects incoming orders, coordinates
  preparation activities, and manages
  oven baking and item progress states.
end note

rectangle "LaPrizza Information System" as LaPrizzaSystem <<Software System>> #C7D2FE {
}

cloud "External Identity Provider" as IdP <<Software System>> #FFF4E6
note right of IdP
  OIDC / OAuth 2.0.
  Google, Microsoft, Auth0 or Keycloak.
  Supports JIT provisioning (Clarification #27).
end note

cloud "SMTP / Transactional Email" as SMTP <<Software System>> #FFF4E6
note right of SMTP
  Activation invitations,
  password reset dispatch.
end note

cloud "Prolog AI Planning Engine" as Prolog <<Software System>> #EDE9FE
note right of Prolog
  SWI-Prolog BOM + Requirements Planning.
  Invoked via REST/JSON from the
  Back-End Monolith (ADR-012).
end note

cloud "Webhook Receiver" as Webhook <<Software System>> #FFF4E6
note right of Webhook
  Maintenance alerts (Sprint 3+).
end note

' Arestas
LaPrizzaSystem --> IdP : [OIDC redirect + ID Token exchange]\nUsers authenticate externally
LaPrizzaSystem --> SMTP : [SMTP / HTTPS]\nDispatches activation emails
LaPrizzaSystem --> Prolog : [HTTPS/JSON]\nRequests BOM and Requirements Planning
LaPrizzaSystem -.> Webhook : [HTTPS webhook]\nFuture: maintenance alerts

' Interactions
Customer --> LaPrizzaSystem : [HTTPS]\nBrowses catalogue, personalizes pizzas, manages profile and places orders
Manager --> LaPrizzaSystem : [HTTPS]\nAdministers taxonomy, catalogues, prices, users, roles, and stock levels
Employee --> LaPrizzaSystem : [HTTPS]\nConsults preparation activities, monitors kitchen schedule, and updates fulfillment

@enduml